flowchart TB
    USER["Assigned task<br/>operator authority already established"]:::client
    OC["OpenClaw TypeScript controller<br/>managed Task Flow adapter<br/>separate controller token"]:::client
    MCP["Go MCP service<br/>workflow + FIFO task checkpoints<br/>version checks and idempotency"]:::service
    PDP["Cerbos<br/>trusted identity + project + resource"]:::gate
    DB[("PostgreSQL authority<br/>workflow events · exact evidence<br/>decisions · outbox")]:::data
    LOCAL["Bounded local execution contract<br/>Ollama + work-packet/v1<br/>independent patch verifier"]:::local
    REVIEW["Conditional read-only review<br/>allowed development miss only<br/>local reproduction of findings"]:::target
    VERIFY["Trusted validation evidence<br/>exact version, revision and context"]:::service
    DEF["Validated domain/capability/metric definitions<br/>operator's delegated task authority<br/>registry validation + exact decision"]:::service
    KB["Generated KB entry<br/>pending until explicit user decision<br/>approved entry → worker → Milvus read-back"]:::pending
    REUSE["Eligible validated reuse<br/>task completes<br/>new candidate remains pending"]:::done
    FUTURE["Still planned<br/>general classifier + isolated agent runner<br/>automatic disclosure packaging<br/>webhook relay + scheduled operations"]:::target
    USER --> OC --> MCP
    MCP --> PDP
    MCP --> DB
    OC -->|execution contract| LOCAL
    LOCAL -.->|when allowed| REVIEW
    LOCAL --> VERIFY
    REVIEW -->|apply locally then validate| VERIFY
    VERIFY --> MCP
    USER -->|authenticated operator, not controller| DEF
    DEF --> MCP
    MCP --> KB
    MCP --> REUSE
    OC -.- FUTURE
    NOTE["Controller cannot inherit the operator's QA/Product Owner roles.<br/>Client unattended settings do not override server policy.<br/>Maintenance inference remains local with no cloud fallback."]:::gate
